('ca0e80ff-73ad-5d78-b79e-1996a3694002', '1fd2e146-9233-4bc7-8fd2-b600f61a7d73', 'd8943c26-698b-4e81-97d1-7588165e9880', 'a-level', '30.6', '9702 coursebook 30.6 · Echo sounding', 22, 22, 'An echo returns from a depth of 7.5 cm in tissue after 100 µs. Calculate the speed of ultrasound in the tissue.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1500', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 2d/t = 2 × 0.075 ÷ 100 × 10⁻⁶ = 1500 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: v = 2d/t. A1: v = 1500 m s⁻¹.', 2, NULL, NULL),
('081c307d-ec3d-58dd-aafc-124bb5f3c994', '1fd2e146-9233-4bc7-8fd2-b600f61a7d73', 'd8943c26-698b-4e81-97d1-7588165e9880', 'a-level', '30.6', '9702 coursebook 30.6 · Echo sounding', 23, 23, 'Sonar on a submarine detects an echo after 1.2 s. Sound travels at 1500 m s⁻¹ in the sea. How far away is the object?', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '900', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'd = 1500 × 1.2 ÷ 2 = 900 m. Mark scheme (1 mark). A1: d = 900 m.', 1, NULL, NULL),
('99d89890-d4ab-57f9-a4eb-f29f5a2a79fc', '1fd2e146-9233-4bc7-8fd2-b600f61a7d73', 'd8943c26-698b-4e81-97d1-7588165e9880', 'a-level', '30.6', '9702 coursebook 30.6 · Echo sounding', 24, 24, 'A whale''s call reflects from an iceberg and returns after 2.4 s. Sound travels at 1500 m s⁻¹ in sea water. How far away is the iceberg?', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1800', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'd = vt/2 = 1500 × 2.4 ÷ 2 = 1800 m. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: half the round trip. A1: d = 1800 m.', 2, NULL, NULL),
